{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood","id":1482572,"title":"Antediluvian Blood","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-31T21:07:16-07:00","id":1482572,"title":"Antediluvian Blood","content":"If you were an extremely powerful mage (let's say Arete 8, with a 6 sphere, a few 5 spheres, a few 4s) and you had a drop or two, or maybe a vial, of antediluvian blood. What would you do?<br /> <br /> For the purposes of discussion, what if the blood was Saulot and Lasombra?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26423-lokitx","name":"LokiTX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T22:08:56-07:00","id":1482574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiTX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood#post1482572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you were an extremely powerful mage (let's say Arete 8, with a 6 sphere, a few 5 spheres, a few 4s) and you had a drop or two, or maybe a vial, of antediluvian blood. What would you do?<br /> <br /> For the purposes of discussion, what if the blood was Saulot and Lasombra?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, would this mage know what an Antediluvian x a methuselah or very old elder is in the first place?<br /> If so, of what tradition, convention, craft or whatever are we talking about and why would he or she be interested in that anyway, versus a bunch of other things that can be far more directly relevant to awakened, specially one in the near-Oracle tier as you suggest?<br /> <br /> Seems a little too vague and broad a subject as is at the present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T04:08:02-07:00","id":1482586,"title":"","content":"I would first &quot;clone&quot; it, to turn it into an &quot;infinite&quot; (as long as I have Quintessence to keep doing it, which I as a near Oracle, certanly would've) supply.<br /> <br /> After that, back to my necromantic lab I go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T15:20:26-07:00","id":1482670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiTX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood#post1482572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you were an extremely powerful mage (let's say Arete 8, with a 6 sphere, a few 5 spheres, a few 4s) and you had a drop or two, or maybe a vial, of antediluvian blood. What would you do?<br /> <br /> For the purposes of discussion, what if the blood was Saulot and Lasombra?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ain't you the guy in the DA crossover game?<br /> <br /> First, analyze it cautiously. Antediluvian Vitae may have any number of properties that common Kindred Vitae does not. It may contain some of the raw essence of Disciplines, or the power to make or break a clan's Weakness, all sorts of things that can achieve extreme value for Vampires and even give you some novel resources. It can also have some unknown traps, specially be under the power of the donor. Being under the control of an Ante by taking their blood is as common a trope as something about them can be.<br /> <br /> Second, duplicating it isn't a bad idea. While it isn't cost-effective Quint-wise, your Vampire pals will have a lot of possible uses for a regenerating supply of Ante Vitae. Being able to Embrace into the 4th Generation, for example, or to, again, distill Disciplines from it, even get temporary access to 10th level powers.<br /> <br /> Third, whatever it doesn't have by itself you can use it to bring the effect. Again, one option would be to give a Vampire temporary access to 10th level Disciplines, but also maybe give a Mage the ability to learn Disciplines directly, which as always have the advantage of not causing Paradox.<br /> <br /> Other than that, you have an extremely strong sympathetic link not only to the Ante in question, but to their entire lineages and maybe even to vampires that Diablerized a member of the lineage. So you have a sympathetic connection to every Salubri and Lasombra, several Bloodlines, possibly the Tremere in the future (AFAIK your game is set before the Diablerie of Saulot) and maybe even the Baali (depending on your ST's reading of their lineage).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T17:06:13-07:00","id":1482681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood?p=1482670#post1482670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Second, duplicating it isn't a bad idea. While it isn't cost-effective Quint-wise, your Vampire pals will have a lot of possible uses for a regenerating supply of Ante Vitae. Being able to Embrace into the 4th Generation, for example, or to, again, distill Disciplines from it, even get temporary access to 10th level powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. &quot;Anti deluvian infinite fountain&quot; directly connected to some several nodes. Endless supply. Bottle up a bunch of the stuff.<br /> <br /> As to what to do with it... Use Life 5, Spirit 5 and Mind 5 (the &quot;minimal&quot; kit set for a true &quot;archmage&quot;) and Matter 5 and Prime 5 (just that? Lol) and turn it into a living being... Just for the sake of experimentation. Create the first &quot;pure blooded&quot; &quot;true&quot; vampire in the world. A creature born out of Vitae, who was never a human. Let's see what the ST has to say about it - let the ST torture himself to deal with it.<br /> <br /> Other things you can do: mind twist the minds of some animals; remove the &quot;beast&quot; out of them, give them human intellect and turn them into 4th generation &quot;animal drones&quot;. Use a simple Prime 1 and Correspondence 3 to find the Antis (althought that might not be wise to do on folks with Auspex). Make talismans to identify Lasombras and Salubri (and possibly Baali and future Tremere) in the vicinities that use a simple Prime 1 to identify the linked ressonance of the blood. Add Correspondence 3 to pinpoint any Lasombra and Salubri in a large are (like a city). After pinpoint them, those become your toys to play with Correspondence 3, since they'll pretty much fall into the &quot;body sample&quot; category of reach.<br /> <br /> Make experimentations with their relative disciplines. Turn shadows alive using Lasombra's Vitae - Mind, Spirit, Life, Forces, Prime, all 5. See what gives.<br /> <br /> Capture a few spirits, turn them into living beings either using Vitae or injecting them with the Antis' Vitae afterwards - preferably BOTH. For example, summon a &quot;spirit of Divination&quot;, binds it and turn it into a living being using the Saulot's Vitae as the &quot;ingredient&quot; and/or (preferably and), turn it into a living being and &quot;embrace it&quot; afterwards with Saulot's Vitae to see what gives.<br /> <br /> If it's not gruesome, you're not doing it right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T19:45:00-07:00","id":1482705,"title":"","content":"Drown an Angel/Demon in a sea of Antedeluvian blood, purely for the irony.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T20:34:45-07:00","id":1482711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood?p=1482670#post1482670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other than that, you have an extremely strong sympathetic link not only to the Ante in question, but to their entire lineages and maybe even to vampires that Diablerized a member of the lineage. So you have a sympathetic connection to every Salubri and Lasombra, several Bloodlines, possibly the Tremere in the future (AFAIK your game is set before the Diablerie of Saulot) and maybe even the Baali (depending on your ST's reading of their lineage).</div> </div> </div> </div>This is pretty much what I was thinking. For spheres, I think:<br /> Correspondence 3 - to track the clan/bloodline, the world over.<br /> Time 2 - to view the history and make predictions.<br /> Prime - at the level to fully understand the resonance of the blood.<br /> Entropy 3 - helps with stabilizing connections. <br /> Mind 3 - Blood Bonds and clan beliefs.<br /> Life 1 - The human dimension...<br /> <br /> Can you gene sequence vampire blood?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T10:16:37-07:00","id":1482787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482572-antediluvian-blood?p=1482711#post1482711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you gene sequence vampire blood?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. It is already stated that DNA gets destroyed by the Embrace (which isn't really that big of a stretch).<br /> <br /> EDIT: if you get something from freshly taken blood, it will be the sequence of the &quot;donor&quot;, not the vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}